const u=(n,t)=>n<=0||t<=0?0:t===1?n:n*(1+t/30),M=(n,t)=>n<=0||t<=0||t>=37?0:n*36/(37-t),e=(n,t)=>n<=0||t<=0?0:n*Math.pow(t,.1);function s(n,t,a=!1,o=null){return a||!n||!t||n<=0||t<=0||t>10||o!==null&&o>4?null:Math.round(u(n,t+(o??0))*10)/10}const c=n=>n===null?null:Math.max(0,Math.round(10-n));function r(n,t=2.5){return n<=0?0:Math.round(t*Math.floor(n/t+1e-9)*100)/100}function l(n){return n>=100?1:Math.max(1,Math.round(30*(100/n-1)))}function R(n,t=2.5){return[100,95,90,85,80,75,70,65,60,55,50].map(a=>({percent:a,weight:r(n*a/100,t),reps:l(a)}))}export{r as a,u as b,M as c,s as e,e as l,R as p,c as r};
